WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.454
A counterexample to Shub's conjecture.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.921
Shub predicted topological growth forces chaos. Here

3
00:00:05.921 --> 00:00:08.424
a sphere doubles, yet nothing spreads.

4
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.295
A squaring sphere, a stalling clock and

5
00:00:11.295 --> 00:00:13.091
small stored signals hide the growth.

6
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.554
Claimed: a C one counterexample, noninvertible.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.946
Checked in Lean.
